{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13102331.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102331","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102331","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310233101:0":{"text":"드디어 해결됐네요! 어서 돌아가서 알려줘야겠어요!","source_cn":"总算搞定了！咱们回去跟那个冒失鬼说一声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF14C6D0310008C81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13102340.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310234001:0":{"text":"여러분을 만나서 다행이에요... 그렇지 않았다면 즐거웠을 “눈사람 쫓기”가 저 때문에 엉망이 되었을 거예요.","source_cn":"幸好碰上了你们……要不然，本来很快乐的“雪人追逐”一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B3203A8CE9549FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1310234001":{"text":"여러분을 만나서 다행이에요... 그렇지 않았다면 즐거웠을 “눈사람 쫓기”가 저 때문에 엉망이 되었을 거예요.","source_cn":"幸好碰上了你们……要不然，本来很快乐的“雪人追逐”一定会被我搞得乱七八糟的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B3203A8CE9549FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310234002:0":{"text":"다음... 다음엔 안 그럴게요!","source_cn":"下次……下次不会了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1997B3CA2D02FFF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var