고 싶은데... 어디 보자...","source_cn":"总之，今天多亏了你们帮忙。我得给你们一些礼物作为报答，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42192C4FDFDA6F8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310234010:0":{"text":"참! 이 “제전의 꽃잎”을 여러분께 드릴게요! 원래 작은 눈사람에게 마법을 행한 것에 대한 보수였는데... 저보다는 여러분들이 받으셔야 할 것 같아서요.","source_cn":"对了！这枚“祭典花瓣”就送给你们吧！它本来是我为小雪人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4925A14B069F861B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310234011:0":{"text":"꽃잎! 고마워요. 그렇다면 사양하지 않을게요!","source_cn":"一枚花瓣！谢谢啦，我们就不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F25C6141AB5A132","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310234012:0":{"text":"제가 감사해야죠. 그럼 안녕히 가세요. 그리고 걱정 마세요, 계속해서 연습할게요!!","source_cn":"是我该谢谢你们才对，再见啦。放心，我会继续精进我的魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE887522A915724DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310234013:0":{"text":"계속 연습한다라... 왠지 더 불안한데요...","source_cn":"“继续精进”……他这么说更让人不放心了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83196CAADF16BE16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"(이름을 알려준다)","source_cn":"（告知名字）"